## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Admin can view and edit Company Profile, Branding, Data Policies, and Audit Trail entries with proper RBAC restrictions.
- [ ] Users: Create, edit, deactivate, and assign Roles with granular permissions. Role editor enforces tenant scoping.
- [ ] Roles & Permissions: Roles defined, permissions enforced in UI and API; changes are auditable.
- [ ] Integrations: Onboard OAuth/API-key connectors; test connections; schedule synchronization; error handling and mapping configured; status reflects live state.
- [ ] Notifications & Alerts: In-app notifications configured; alert rules and scheduled reports deliver via push/email; delivery status visible.
- [ ] User Profile Management: Users can manage own profile; scoped API keys created for builders with proper restrictions.
- [ ] Feature Flags: Per-tenant feature toggles with rollout configuration; changes appear in audit logs.
- [ ] Data retention and export capabilities function as defined; retention windows enforced.
- [ ] Accessibility and keyboard navigation are functional across all components.
- [ ] All API reads handle potential null/undefined values safely; all lists are guarded as per runtime safety rules.
- [ ] Visual design aligns with the provided color palette, typography, and layout guidelines.

