## UI/UX Guidelines
Apply the project's design system to all components:
- Follow the Visual Style and Color Palette provided
- Use Poppins/Manrope for headings and Inter/Roboto for UI text
- Implement 12-column responsive grid with the hero-left, card-right composition for the Settings overview
- Cards: deep surfaces with subtle inner shadows and light borders
- Interactive elements: clear focus states and hover feedback
- Data visualizations: minimal, precise, and accessible
- Consistent micro-UI patterns for chips, pills, and tag outlines

