## Visual Style

Color Palette (as provided)
- Background primary: #05060A
- Center glow: gradient #071228 → #0B1A2A
- Surface / cards: #0F1720
- Inset panels: #0C1116
- Primary accent: #9AD0FF
- Secondary accent: #154E78
- Live indicator: #00D27A
- Neutral text: #8FA0B0
- Strong text: #F7FAFF
- Subtle borders: rgba(255,255,255,0.03)
- Primary CTA: #FFFFFF
- Dark CTA text: #081017
- Secondary filled/toggle: #0F1720

Typography & Layout
- Headings: Poppins/Manrope, weights 700–900, desktop hero H1 56–96px
- Body: Inter/Roboto, 400–600
- Micro-labels: 10–12px uppercase
- 12-column grid with generous gutters; hero left 6–7 columns, right 4–5 columns
- Spacing: base 8px scale; paddings/margins 8/16/24/32/48/64

Key Design Elements
- Cards: rounded 12–16px, gradient/light stroke, hover elevation
- Navigation: top-centered links, top-right white pill CTA
- Data Visualization: pale blue lines, neon green accents
- Buttons/Inputs: primary pills, ghost/dark, micro-pills; focus rings in pale blue
- Live indicators: neon green pulse

Design Philosophy
- Modern, enterprise-grade, data-first clarity
- Minimal clutter; scalable components
- Secure, auditable, tenant-isolated experience

