This prompt provides a comprehensive, actionable blueprint for building the Settings / Preferences module with integrated User Profile Management, Notifications & Alerts, Integrations & Connectors, and a robust Role & Permission model. It enforces safe runtime patterns, defines data models and endpoints, and prescribes a clear build order prioritizing authentication and core data setup before dashboard/analytics work. It is ready to feed into an AI development tool to generate code, schemas, and UI/UX deliverables aligned with the Connected AI Business OS project.

